      en: ["The church was built between 1877 and 1883 in the Neo-Gothic style.", "The main tower of the church reaches an impressive height of 60 meters.", "The Belgian sculptor Gerard Goffin crafted the church's main altar.", "The crypt contains the tombs of the Tyzenhauz noble family.", "The organ was installed in 1883 and remains functional today.", "The building was constructed according to the designs of architect Georg Werner."],
