      en: ["Constructed between 1903 and 1909", "Designed by architect Józef Pius Dziekoński", "Towers reach a height of about 60 meters", "Built in the Neo-Gothic brick style", "Contains a notable early 20th-century organ", "Spiritual center of the Šilalė parish"],
      es: ["Construcción de 1903 a 1909", "Arquitecto: Józef Pius Dziekoński", "Las torres alcanzan unos 60 metros de altura", "Estilo neogótico de ladrillo visto", "Órgano importante de principios del siglo XX", "Centro de la parroquia de Šilalė"],
