      en: ["Built between 1640 and 1649, blending Renaissance and Baroque", "Features a cruciform plan with distinctive decorative gables", "Houses five ornate Baroque altars and a historic pulpit", "Restored several times following historical fires and wars", "Šeduva was granted Magdeburg rights in the year 1654", "A major landmark of ecclesiastical architecture in the region"],
